cted Within Its Remit In Ecuador Dispute', 'text': 'THE HAGUE COURT RULES FOR CHEVRON IN ECUADOR DISPUTE.CHEVRON - INTERNATIONAL ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL FOUND $9.5 BILLION ECUADORIAN JUDGMENT AGAINST CO PROCURED THROUGH FRAUD, CORRUPTION BY PLAINTIFFS’ LEGAL TEAM.CHEVRON - INTERNATIONAL ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL ALSO REJECTED UNDERLYING ENVIRONMENTAL ALLEGATIONS AGAINST CHEVRON.CHEVRON - TRIBUNAL FOUND THAT CO\'S SUBSIDIARY COMPLETED AN ENVIRONMENTAL REMEDIATION PROGRAM SUPERVISED AND APPROVED BY REPUBLIC OF ECUADOR.CHEVRON - DISTRICT COURT OF THE HAGUE UPHELD THE AWARD IN FULL AND REJECTED THE REPUBLIC OF ECUADOR’S ATTEMPT TO SET IT ASIDE.CHEVRON - COURT FOUND THAT INTERNATIONAL TRIBUNAL ACTED WITHIN ITS REMIT WHEN ISSUING THE AWARD.CHEVRON - COURT HELD THAT "BECAUSE NONE OF SETTING ASIDE GROUNDS BROUGHT FORWARD BY ECUADOR SUCCEED, CLAIMS WILL BE DENIED".CHEVRON-COURT CONCLUDED TRIBUNAL’S ORDERS PROPERLY SOUGHT TO “REMOVE THE CONSEQUENCES OF A FRAUDULENT JUDGMENT THAT WAS RENDERED BY A CORRUPT JUDGE.".CHEVRON-COURT’S RULING FOLLOWS DECISIONS FROM COURTS IN ARGENTINA, BRAZIL, CANADA, GIBRALTAR, U.S. REJECTING FRAUDULENT ECUADORIAN JUDGMENT AGAINST CO.'}{'symbol': 'KO', 'date': '2020-09-17 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Coca-Cola Offers €1 Billion Of 0.125% Notes Due 2029, €750 Million Of 0.375% Notes Due 2033', 'text': 'COCA-COLA CO - OFFERING €1 BILLION OF 0.125% NOTES DUE 2029, €750 MILLION OF 0.375% NOTES DUE 2033, €850 MILLION OF 0.800% NOTES DUE 2040.'}{'symbol': 'DAL', 'date': '2020-09-17 21:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Delta Says Cancels Select Flights Following Impact Of Hurricane Sally On Gulf Coast', 'text': 'DELTA AIR LINES - DELTA CANCELS SELECT FLIGHTS, ADDS TO EXISTING TRAVEL WAIVER FOLLOWING IMPACT OF HURRICANE SALLY ON THE GULF COAST.'}{'symbol': 'DVN', 'date': '2020-09-17 17:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Devon Energy Announces Fourth-Quarter 2020 Cash Dividend For Common Stockholders', 'text': 'DEVON ENERGY ANNOUNCES FOURTH-QUARTER 2020 CASH DIVIDEND FOR COMMON STOCKHOLDERS.DEV